exports[`modules: AVAILABLE and PLANNED are shown apart, PLANNED never as ready (FE-16.1) > renders a PLANNED module as a planned extension point (snapshot) 1`] = `"<li class="rounded-md border px-4 py-3 border-dashed border-border bg-surface-2" data-testid="registry-module" data-code="irrbb_eve" data-status="PLANNED" data-module-version-id="33333333-3333-4333-8333-333333333333"><div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-calendar-clock h-4 w-4 text-muted-foreground" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M21 7.5V6a2 2 0 0 0-2-2H5a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v14a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h3.5"></path><path d="M16 2v4"></path><path d="M8 2v4"></path><path d="M3 10h5"></path><path d="M17.5 17.5 16 16.3V14"></path><circle cx="16" cy="16" r="6"></circle></svg><span class="font-medium">IRRBB economic value (planned)</span><span class="font-mono text-xs text-muted-foreground">irrbb_eve v1</span><span class="inline-flex items-center rounded-sm border px-2 py-0.5 text-xs font-medium status-draft" title="Not selectable: a declared extension point. Its input and output contracts are fixed, but no engine implements it in this release, and the server refuses a run of it (409 module_not_available)." data-testid="planned-module-badge" data-status="PLANNED">Planned — extension point</span><span class="inline-flex flex-wrap items-center gap-1"><div class="inline-flex items-center rounded-sm border px-2 py-0.5 text-xs font-medium transition-colors focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-ring focus:ring-offset-2 border-[hsl(var(--warning)/0.3)] bg-[hsl(var(--warning)/0.1)] text-[hsl(var(--warning))]" data-testid="illustrative-badge" title="Illustrative prototype. Not a regulatory calculation.">Illustrative</div><div class="inline-flex items-center rounded-sm border px-2 py-0.5 text-xs font-medium transition-colors focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-ring focus:ring-offset-2 border-[hsl(var(--warning)/0.3)] bg-[hsl(var(--warning)/0.1)] text-[hsl(var(--warning))]" data-testid="provisional-badge" title="Provisional: awaiting the client&#x27;s own value.">Provisional</div></span></div><p class="mt-1 text-sm text-muted-foreground">Declared extension point for interest-rate risk in the banking book.</p><p class="mt-2 text-xs text-muted-foreground" data-testid="module-planned-note">Planned extension point: declared so runs and reports can name it, not implemented in this release. It cannot be selected for a run and is not production-ready.</p><dl class="grid grid-cols-[140px_1fr] gap-x-3 gap-y-1 text-xs mt-3" data-testid="module-contracts"><dt class="text-muted-foreground">Reads schemas</dt><dd class="font-mono text-xs" data-testid="contract-schemas">instrument (required): instrument_id</dd><dt class="text-muted-foreground">Reads rules</dt><dd class="font-mono text-xs" data-testid="contract-rules"><span class="text-muted-foreground">—</span></dd><dt class="text-muted-foreground">Assumption keys</dt><dd class="font-mono text-xs" data-testid="contract-assumption-keys"><span class="text-muted-foreground">—</span></dd><dt class="text-muted-foreground">Run parameters</dt><dd class="font-mono text-xs" data-testid="contract-parameters"><span class="text-muted-foreground">—</span></dd><dt class="text-muted-foreground">Writes results</dt><dd class="font-mono text-xs" data-testid="contract-results"><span class="text-muted-foreground">—</span></dd><dt class="text-muted-foreground">Intermediates</dt><dd class="font-mono text-xs" data-testid="contract-intermediates"><span class="text-muted-foreground">—</span></dd><dt class="text-muted-foreground">Warning codes</dt><dd class="font-mono text-xs" data-testid="contract-warning-codes"><span class="text-muted-foreground">—</span></dd></dl><dl class="mt-3 grid grid-cols-[160px_1fr] gap-y-1 text-sm"><dt class="text-muted-foreground">Rules</dt><dd><